  "details": "VRChat Version:2021.2.4p1\nDescription of the bug:After removing the cache data, the download of the world stops at 0% when playing the game again, and when pressing [Go to Default Home], the game is turned on when the error message [None] is printed, not progressed, Also, when the game is played again, the game turns on normally, but the cache data remains undeleted.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):In-game, click [Advanced Setting] Clear Cache Data, and then restart the game.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): Nope :(",
